runtime:  Mono JIT compiler version 6.8.0.105 (Debian 6.8.0.105+dfsg-3.6ubuntu2 Sun Mar 31 02:55:28 UTC 2024)
          net48 assembly, Mono on Linux. README 5's C# row names netstandard2.0
          first and .NET Framework 4.8 failing that; on Linux net48 IS Mono, and
          6.8.0.105 is the version the published report's ~73 ns crossing came from.
sources:  AK_FLOOR, LINKED from ../Facade and ../Harness. One source tree.
